  "description": "Margarita Cocktail Clipart Bundle\nThis high-quality sublimation clipart design is perfect for creating unique products. Just download and you can use this design for create cards, banners, posters, labels, social media, ads, promotions, packaging, textile design, cases, scrapbooking, branding, web -design, logo design, website, t-shirt, pillow, pop-socket, sweater, jumper, hoodie, sticker, mug, bags and any other items to add a fun, eye-catching touch to your store.\nYou will receive a zip file containing the following, immediately after your purchase.\n• 25 PNG file (4096X4096)\n• 25 JPG file (4096X4096)\n• 1 PDF file\n• Transparent background\n• High resolution\n• Not editable but the buyer is responsible for resizing the design to fit their chosen product.\nWhat you can do.\n• Use the graphics, even without changes, for any printed or physical product.\n• Use the graphics, even without changes, for any print on demand product.\n• Use the graphics for any digital finished end product which is your own design and has had creative changes made.\nPlease note: You are purchasing a digital file only. No physical product will be shipped.\nThanks for shopping with us.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Margarita Cocktail Clipart Bundle</p>\n<p>This high-quality sublimation clipart design is perfect for creating unique products. Just download and you can use this design for create cards, banners, posters, labels, social media, ads, promotions, packaging, textile design, cases, scrapbooking, branding, web -design, logo design, website, t-shirt, pillow, pop-socket, sweater, jumper, hoodie, sticker, mug, bags and any other items to add a fun, eye-catching touch to your store.</p>\n<p>You will receive a zip file containing the following, immediately after your purchase.<br>\n• 25 PNG file (4096X4096)<br>\n• 25 JPG file (4096X4096)<br>\n• 1 PDF file<br>\n• Transparent background<br>\n• High resolution<br>\n• Not editable but the buyer is responsible for resizing the design to fit their chosen product.</p>\n<p>What you can do.<br>\n• Use the graphics, even without changes, for any printed or physical product.<br>\n• Use the graphics, even without changes, for any print on demand product.<br>\n• Use the graphics for any digital finished end product which is your own design and has had creative changes made.</p>\n<p>Please note: You are purchasing a digital file only. No physical product will be shipped.</p>\n<p>Thanks for shopping with us.</p>",
